    {
        "name": "Scent Gland Hyperplasia",
        "name_ja": "臭腺過形成",
        "symptoms": {"enlarged_scent_gland", "excessive_oily_secretion", "hair_loss_on_head"},
        "description": "Scent Gland Hyperplasia is a clinical condition requiring veterinary evaluation, diagnosis, and appropriate treatment.",
        "description_ja": "前頭部（頭部）または胸骨臭腺の肥大と機能亢進で、未去勢の雄に多いです。",
        "urgency": "low",
        "recommended_tests": ["physical_exam", "cytology"],
        "causes": "Caused by testosterone-driven hyperplasia and hyperactivity of the frontal (head) or sternal scent glands, predominantly in intact (unneutered) males.",
        "causes_ja": "フクロモモンガにおける臭腺過形成の原因: 前頭部（頭部）または胸骨臭腺の肥大と機能亢進で、未去勢の雄に多いです。",
        "pathophysiology": "The pathological process involves tissue injury, inflammatory response, and progressive functional impairment. Without intervention, compensatory mechanisms may be overwhelmed, leading to clinical deterioration.",
        "pathophysiology_ja": "臭腺過形成はフクロモモンガにおける皮膚疾患である。表皮バリア、真皮炎症、または付属器機能の障害を伴う。バリア機能の低下により経表皮水分喪失、アレルゲン浸透、微生物コロニー形成が促進される。炎症メディエーター（ヒスタミン、プロスタグランジン、サイトカイン）が掻痒、紅斑、二次的な擦過傷を駆動する。慢性疾患では表皮過形成、苔癬化、色素沈着、線維化が生じる。",
        "treatment": "SCENT GLAND HYPERPLASIA IN SUGAR GLIDERS: (1) CASTRATION (DEFINITIVE TREATMENT): Surgical castration eliminates testosterone stimulation—the primary driver of scent gland hyperplasia. Technique: closed castration under isoflurane general anesthesia (mask induction 3-4%, maintenance 1.5-2.5%). Pre-op fasting 2-4h only (hypoglycemia risk). Post-op: meloxicam 0.2 mg/kg PO/SC q24h × 5-7 days, E-collar or body wrap to prevent wound interference. Gland regression begins 2-4 weeks post-castration, complete involution by 6-8 weeks. Additional benefits: reduced aggression, reduced urine marking, improved compatibility for group housing. (2) SECONDARY INFECTION MANAGEMENT: If gland infected (erythema, purulent discharge, pain): culture + sensitivity. Empirical: enrofloxacin 5-10 mg/kg PO q12h × 10-14 days. Topical: chlorhexidine 0.05% bid cleaning + mupirocin 2% or silver sulfadiazine 1% to affected area. (3) CONSERVATIVE (if castration declined): Gentle warm water cleansing of gland area q2-3 days. Topical anti-inflammatory if irritated. Monitor for secondary infection, abscessation, or neoplastic transformation. (4) DIFFERENTIAL: Distinguish from scent gland adenoma/carcinoma—FNA cytology if mass is firm, rapidly growing, ulcerated, or fails to regress post-castration. Ref: Johnson-Delaney 2006, Brust 2013, Carpenter Exotic Animal Formulary 6th ed.",
        "treatment_ja": "フクロモモンガの臭腺過形成治療：(1) 去勢（根治的治療）：外科的去勢はテストステロン刺激（臭腺過形成の主要因）を排除。手技：イソフルラン全身麻酔下（マスク導入3-4%、維持1.5-2.5%）での閉鎖式去勢。術前絶食は2-4時間のみ（低血糖リスク）。術後：メロキシカム0.2 mg/kg PO/SC q24h×5-7日、創傷干渉防止のためエリザベスカラーまたはボディラップ。去勢後2-4週で腺退縮開始、6-8週で完全退縮。追加利点：攻撃性低減・尿マーキング低減・グループ飼育の互換性向上。(2) 二次感染管理：腺感染時（発赤・膿性分泌・疼痛）：培養＋感受性。経験的：エンロフロキサシン5-10 mg/kg PO q12h×10-14日。局所：クロルヘキシジン0.05% bid清拭＋ムピロシン2%またはスルファジアジン銀1%を患部に。(3) 保存的（去勢拒否時）：腺部を2-3日毎に温水で愛護的に清拭。炎症時は局所抗炎症薬。二次感染・膿瘍形成・腫瘍性変化をモニタリング。(4) 鑑別：臭腺腺腫/癌との区別—腫瘤が硬い・急速増大・潰瘍化・去勢後退縮しない場合はFNA細胞診。参考文献：Johnson-Delaney 2006, Brust 2013, Carpenter Exotic Animal Formulary 6th ed。",
        "prevention": "Elective castration of non-breeding males at 5-6 months OOP (out of pouch) age prevents scent gland hyperplasia before onset. Neutering also reduces aggression, urine marking, and improves social compatibility. Regular gland hygiene: gentle warm water cleaning of head/sternal glands during routine health checks. Monitor intact males for gland enlargement, infection, or behavioral changes. Annual veterinary exam with gland assessment.",
        "prevention_ja": "非繁殖雄のOOP（袋外）5-6ヶ月齢での選択的去勢が発症前に臭腺過形成を予防。去勢は攻撃性低減・尿マーキング低減・社会的互換性向上にも有効。定期的な腺衛生：定期健診時に頭部/胸骨腺を温水で愛護的に清拭。未去勢雄の腺腫大・感染・行動変化をモニタリング。腺評価を含む年1回の獣医師健診。",
        "prognosis": "Excellent with castration—complete gland regression in 6-8 weeks, recurrence rate <1%. Infected glands: good with antibiotics + castration (resolution 2-3 weeks). Without castration: chronic/progressive, requiring ongoing management; risk of secondary infection and potential neoplastic transformation increases with age. Scent gland carcinoma (rare but reported): guarded—depends on metastatic status at diagnosis.",
        "prognosis_ja": "去勢で優秀—6-8週で完全腺退縮、再発率<1%。感染腺：抗菌薬＋去勢で良好（2-3週で消退）。去勢なし：慢性/進行性で継続管理が必要；加齢とともに二次感染リスクと腫瘍性変化の可能性が増加。臭腺癌（稀だが報告あり）：慎重—診断時の転移状態に依存。",
        "onset_pattern": {"acute", "subacute"},
        "age_predisposition": {"adult", "young", "senior"},
    },
